  "findings": [
    "RepoWise builds a local structural, dependency, git-history, decision, documentation, and code-health index without requiring an LLM in --no-prose mode.",
    "Its stdio MCP server exposes task-shaped overview, context, symbol, search, risk, change-risk, health, why, dead-code, and repository tools with response budgeting.",
    "Its official Codex setup writes project-local MCP configuration, lifecycle hooks, and managed AGENTS.md guidance.",
    "Its distill subsystem can compact supported command output with reversible omission markers, but command rewriting is opt-in and is not part of the prepared default non-interactive profiles.",
    "Maintainer benchmark claims were identified but not independently audited or reproduced by this source-logic inspection."
  ]
